OL,3,GNEWSAParents want crossing after
OL,4,Achildren hurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a girl injured in a road
OL,7,Ftraffic accident in East Sussex is
OL,8,Ffrustrated that local authorities have
OL,9,Fnot taken action to install a
OL,10,Fpedestrian crossing.
OL,12,FToki Snook's daughter and her friend
OL,13,Fwere injured in March after being
OL,14,Fstruck by a car while crossing
OL,15,FAmberstone in Hailsham, between Linnet
OL,16,FLane and Trefoil Road.
OL,18,FSnook said that while both girls are
OL,19,F"physically doing much better", her
OL,20,Fdaughter is struggling mentally and now
OL,21,F"freezes when she sees cars".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
